WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.369 --> 00:00:03.580
(dramatic music)

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.863
- I have visual on their ship.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.543
This is organized crime.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.360
- Mexico Narco traffickers call totoaba

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.640
the cocaine of the sea.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:21.990
The fishing of the totoaba
by Chinese traffickers

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:25.918
and Mexican cartels is
killing the vaquita.

00:00:25.918 --> 00:00:28.900
The vaquita is getting extinct.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.420
- There were a hundred
and then there were 60,

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.380
and now there's fewer than 30.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.220
Come on, sweetie.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.710
Come on, mama.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.150
- [Man In Black] To stop
the killing of the vaquita,

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:41.200
we have to take down those traffickers.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.830
The whole thing stinks.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.140
It is corruption all the way.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:46.307
Who is...

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:53.920
- [Woman] There are some
really bad guys here.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.520
They don't wanna see us succeed.

00:01:02.525 --> 00:01:04.180
(placid music)

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.860
- [Man In Black] If we
don't save the vaquita,

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:08.853
we will lose the most
beautiful places of the planet.

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:12.820
I keep thinking about the moment

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.713
when only one vaquita
will be left in the wild.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.700
- [Man In Blue] This is a war against

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.123
the extinction of a species.

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:23.510
- [Woman] We have to hold onto the hope

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:24.560
that it's gonna work.

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:27.413
- [Man] The poachers are unacceptable.

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:30.483
They'll take any means necessary.

00:01:32.741 --> 00:01:34.110
- Clock's ticking.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.083
- [Man] We will fight
for every single life.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:39.413
We won't stop.

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:43.316
(mysterious music)

00:01:49.274 --> 00:01:51.941
(water lapping)

